"""
goodhunter — detect and optionally neutralize Windows monitoring software.

Modes:
  normal     broad PowerShell enumeration (transparent, for personal machines)
  --stealth  targeted .NET checks only, no broad enumeration, no disk writes
  --neutralize  kill processes, stop services, block C2 domains of what's found
  --portable generate a standalone .ps1 to run from USB on a machine without Python

Usage:
  goodhunter                  normal scan (transparent)
  goodhunter --stealth        stealth scan (targeted, minimal footprint)
  goodhunter --neutralize     scan + disable what's found
  goodhunter --stealth --neutralize  stealth scan + disable
  goodhunter list             list all tools in the database
  goodhunter scan             normal scan only (no report save)
  goodhunter report           show last scan report
  goodhunter cat <name>       show details of a specific tool
  goodhunter --portable       generate stealth .ps1 to a USB directory
  goodhunter --json           output in JSON format
  goodhunter --help
"""

